    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d437-a1">

                <pb facs="0511" n="451" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg451"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 510.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Betts to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >State of Connecticut,<lb/>Office of the Insurance
                                Commissioner</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hartford</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1895-12-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 23, 1895</hi></date>. (Received
                        December 31.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Permit me to request that you will have
                    forwarded through the proper channels to Prince von Hohenlohe, chancellor of the
                    German Empire, the accompanying communication from the department of insurance
                    of the State of Connecticut.</p>
                <p>Believe me, very truly, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Frederick A. Betts</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Commissioner</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
